Difference between object and JSON 
================================
Here it is in proper tabular format:

| Feature            | Object                   | JSON                      |
| ------------------ | ------------------------ | ------------------------- |
| Type               | In-memory data structure | Text format               |
| Exists Where       | Inside the program       | Network / File            |
| Functions Allowed  | Yes                      | No                        |
| Language Dependent | Yes                      | No (language-independent) |
| Used For           | Logic & Processing       | Data Transfer             |

